        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Pathogenic GATA2 variant plus either immunodeficiency or characteristic clinical features",
    "notes": "Diagnosis may be supported by family history and exclusion of other causes"
